| 层 | 名称 | 落地位置 | 状态 |
|----|------|---------|------|
| L1 | Memory | `.workbuddy/memory/` | ✅ 五文件分层 |
| L2 | Knowledge | `.workbuddy/skills/` (38 symlink) | ✅ 已下沉 |
| L3 | Guardrail | `.workbuddy/hooks/` (pre/post-task.sh) | ✅ 4 Gate |
